r":false,"num_turns":14,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"PKT-0046 is finished and committed. The new sdkjs common oracle passes 4 of 4 suites (300 of 300 assertions). It only checks the Builder API, so most of the common module still has no test behind it. Both acceptance commands pass: `unit.sh` gave 178 passed and 1 skipped, and `lint:check` gave 0 errors and 1 warning that was already there.\n\n**What I added**\n- **`.theseus/oracle/sdkjs-common.sh` and `sdkjs-common-run.cjs`**: these run the `external/sdkjs/tests/common` QUnit suites headless. I copied them from the PKT-0044 word oracle. The script runs the `common/` suites listed in upstream `tests/runAll.js`, plus every other page under `tests/common`.\n- **Run time**: about 11 to 20 seconds. The first run in a fresh worktree adds about 2 minutes of setup (`npm ci` and `npm run develop`).\n- **Atlas card `sdkjs-common`**: oracle level is now `unit` and its source is the new script. The card has a table of results and lists what the suites don't test: font loading, co-editing send/apply, history/undo, DrawingML serialization, charts/SmartArt and clipboard. Refactors in those areas need their own checks.\n\n**Results and decisions**\n- **Passing**: the four upstream api suites (word, cell, slide, visio), 75 of 75 assertions each.\n- **Skipped, compiled variants**: the four `*-compiled.html` pages need a full `npm run build`, which the oracle doesn't do.\n- **Skipped, broken**: two suites that upstream `runAll.js` doesn't list.\n  - `color-mods` fails 11 tests (9766 of 10023 assertions).\n  - `chartEx-serialize` doesn't finish within 120 seconds.\n\n  I left them out so the oracle stays green. `ORACLE_ALL=1` still runs them. I filed a follow-up request in `.theseus/spawn/` to find out why they fail; it is an `investigate` packet and needs the browser.\n\n**Not done:** I didn't try a longer timeout for `chartEx-serialize`, and didn't run the `libfont/test/` pages or the compiled variants.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas**\n- Upstream `runAll.js` lists the suites known to pass. Other suites in the tree may be broken, so don't use them as checks until they've been looked at.\n- The runner code is now duplicated between word and common, because the word runner was outside this packet's target. I recorded that in the friction line; a shared runner that takes the editor as a parameter would fix it.\n\nThe commit touched 6 files, which is exactly the packet's file budget.","ttft_ms":2188,"type":"result","duration_ms":226860,"uuid":"6655e0cf-080f-4ee9-be47-9ad7af7a8af4","ttft_stream_ms":1200,"time_to_request_ms":574,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":404,"resume_other":1,"process_user_input":4,"input_attachments":35,"input_hooks":3,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":9,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":6,"init_frame_send":6,"engine_pickup":6,"loop_entry":4,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":11,"query_setup":3,"auto_mode_context_wait":28,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":33,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":2,"request_build":9},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":68,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":261,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":214,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":139,"process_rss_mib_result":231,"process_anon_mib_result":137,"process_peak_rss_mib":267,"process_cpu_ms_turn":5723,"process_wall_ms_turn":226859,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":1615,"process_wall_ms_streaming":57802,"main_stream_count":14,"main_stream_event_count":1117,"main_stream_chunk_count":813,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_prefetch","slowest_producer_ms":7,"cpu_ms":43,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":1,"prompt_producers_ms":1,"ambient_start_ms":23,"ambient_wait_ms":7,"render_ms":1,"producers":41,"token_counts":0},"first_content_frame_ms":1201,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":16239979,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"flag_f